  "lifecycle_tests": [
    "Unauthenticated and another authenticated owner receive denial on all writes.",
    "Authenticated configured owner without sgnews_publish cannot acquire lease or mutate.",
    "Caller supplying arbitrary post ID, author, taxonomy, status, meta or unknown keys is rejected.",
    "Two simultaneous same-event requests produce at most one managed JA and one managed EN post mapping.",
    "Same revision and same digest is a true no-op; same revision with different digest fails; stale revision cannot overwrite newer stored content.",
    "Expired/released/replaced lease token cannot save or publish; old fencing generation fails after successor acquires.",
    "Lease validate and guarded write are atomic; expiration before commit cannot allow an old worker to overwrite a successor.",
    "Wrong owner/category/language/manager marker/current content digest blocks mutation.",
    "Only JA ready or only EN ready blocks pair publication.",
    "Both ready with missing/incorrect SEO or QA artifact digest blocks publication.",
    "Core REST or wp-admin attempts cannot publish/delete managed draft outside the dedicated guarded route.",
    "Failed save restores every temporarily bypassed filter/capability context and prevents later unvalidated saves.",
    "Crash after draft creation but before response recovers mapping without duplicate post creation.",
    "Crash/exception after first-language publication records durable partial state; retry addresses only remaining peer and never recreates posts.",
    "Directly changed managed post content causes digest mismatch and fail-closed publication.",
    "All article fragments survive stored content.raw read-back unchanged after canonical serialization, and real browser parses canonical HTML without additional nodes.",
    "All bounded input limits fail before expensive parse or persistence; recursion and SVG coordinate/path limits enforce finite values.",
    "A registered probe shortcode with a side-effect counter remains unexecuted through the final public the_content filter chain. Encode literal square brackets in canonical HTML text and attribute values or fail closed; prohibit bracket syntax in CSS. Recheck future shortcode tags cannot activate earlier stored content."
  ]
}
